<div id="AboutBlock" class="bg- 2xl:mr-5 2xl:pr-5">
  <ContentFeature
    title="About Me"
    paragraph1="GOAL: TO CREATE NOT JUST GENERIC TEMPLATES BUT A BRAND!- designer specializing in retro-modern desert minimal web experiences"
    paragraph2="But the real opportunity isn’t the aesthetic alone — it’s who needs that aesthetic."
    paragraph3="For a long time, I thought of myself mostly as a builder—someone who made things work. But living in Joshua Tree, surrounded by wide skies, strange plants, and creative people, something shifted. I started to see the web not just as a tool, but as a canvas."
    paragraph4="I’ve been learning how to be more creative—not just with code, but with how I think, feel, and design. I pay more attention now: to shape and space, to rhythm and flow, to how a site feels when you land on it. I study how artists express themselves, how stories are told visually, and how to make websites feel more like places than pages."
  />
